  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>Marrow&#39;s only moon, an ice body with a shallow brine sea and a crust that fractures at every periastron pass and heals over the following decades. It carries the sector&#39;s forward station, because a habitat is easier to keep alive here than on the world below and the view of the thaw is better. Between six and twenty-two people are on it in any given decade.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
